## Description

This function demonstrates various link types. See `simple` for a simpler example. Also see `stats::lm` for linear models.

## Usage

```r
with_links(data)
```

## Arguments

::: {.list-table header-rows=1}

- - Argument
  - Description

- - `data`
  - A data frame. See `base::data.frame`.

:::

## See Also

`simple`, `ggplot2::ggplot`

## Examples

```{r}
with_links(mtcars)
```
